Vector Search = Meaning Match

RAG          = Vector Search + Generate

RAG types:

Self-RAG     = Vector Search + Generate + Self Check

CRAG         = Vector Search + Context Check + Generate

Fusion RAG   = Multiple Queries + Multiple Vector Searches + Fusion/Merge + Reranker + Generate

Hybrid RAG   = BM25 + Vector Search + Reranker + Generate.  BM25 is a keyword search and Vector Search is Meaning Match. Since combination its a Hybrid RAG.
